{"id":"H0387","lemma":"אֵיתָן","transliteration":"etan","sayIt":"e-TAN","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ethan","meaning":"A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ki.4.31;\nson of: Mahol (H4235);\nbrother of: Heman (H1968), Calcol (H3633) and Darda (H1862)\n§ Ethan = \"enduring\"\n1) an Ezrahite known for his wisdom\n2) a grandson of Judah, father of Azariah\n3) a Kohathite descendant of Levi\n4) a Merarite son of Kushaiah, descendant of Levi","glosses":["ethan","wiser than ethan"],"count":8,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ki-4","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"wiser than Ethan","kjv":"than Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ethan","kjv":"and Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ethan","kjv":"of Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ethan","kjv":"of Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":44,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ethan","kjv":"Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-15","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ethan","kjv":"Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-15","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Ethan","kjv":"and Ethan"}},{"chapterId":"psa-89","v":0,"renderings":{}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Kings 4:31","note":"For he was wiser than all men; than Ethan the Ezrahite, Heman, Calcol, and Darda, the sons of Mahol: and his fame was in all the nations all around.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:6","note":"The sons of Zerah: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol, and Dara; five of them in all.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 89:0","note":"","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1968","lemma":"הֵימָן","transliteration":"heman","gloss":"Heman"},{"id":"H3633","lemma":"כַּלְכֹּל","transliteration":"kalkol","gloss":"Calcol"},{"id":"H3098","lemma":"יוֹאָח","transliteration":"yoach","gloss":"Joah"},{"id":"H3038","lemma":"יְדוּתוּן","transliteration":"yedutun","gloss":"Jeduthun"},{"id":"H4235","lemma":"מָחוֹל","transliteration":"machol","gloss":"Mahol"},{"id":"H1862","lemma":"דַּרְדַּע","transliteration":"darda","gloss":"Darda"},{"